WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.680
"Hmm." Jan looked thoughtful.

2
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:25.760
"If an experienced kid successfully rides Sunny, maybe Jon will consider keeping him.

3
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.580
So, Daisy, let's have you ride Sunny during the lesson.

4
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.820
We'll switch to an older horse for you for the trail ride."

5
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:39.700
Daisy still felt guilty for lying to Jan. But she was excited to ride Sunny.

6
00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:42.642
"Thanks, Jan," she said.

7
00:00:42.643 --> 00:00:47.064
Then she whispered to Sunny, "I'm actually not very experienced.

8
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.965
But I can talk to you, so that's just as good, right?"

9
00:00:50.966 --> 00:01:00.647
"Sure," Sunny said. "We'll have fun!"

10
00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:05.960
Jan showed Grace how to brush Blossom and put on her saddle.

11
00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:14.430
Daisy watched carefully, copying what Jan did.

12
00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:36.106
"Is this okay, Sunny?" she whispered, setting a saddle on Sunny's back.

13
00:01:36.107 --> 00:01:40.106
"Yep," he said.

14
00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.660
"Hey, Daisy, do you think they'll send me back?

15
00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.020
I don't like the dealer's farm.

16
00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.180
It's crowded, and the other horses steal my hay."

17
00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:53.220
"If you're very good today, Jan and Jon might let you stay," Daisy whispered.

18
00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.840
"I'll do my best!" Sunny snorted.

19
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.180
"Hey, there's a bird! I want to race it!"

20
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.460
He lunged toward it, tugging against his tie.

21
00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:12.680
"Sunny, no!" Daisy whispered. "You have to be good, remember?"

22
00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.540
"Oops, sorry!" Sunny said.

23
00:02:20.023 --> 00:02:24.951
Jan started the girls' riding lesson.

24
00:02:24.952 --> 00:02:28.814
"We talk to the horse using our aids," she said.

25
00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:33.310
"Your aids are your legs, your hands, and your voice."

26
00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.270
"My voice?" Grace said.

27
00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:40.430
Jan smiled. "Yes. Horses know some words."

28
00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:43.209
"That's for sure!" Daisy thought.

29
00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:46.510
"Especially when I'm talking to them!"

30
00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.610
"Daisy, why don't you demonstrate your aids?" Jan said.

31
00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:58.210
"Watch her, Grace. Daisy will squeeze her legs to ask Sunny to walk.

32
00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:03.310
She'll also make sure she's not pulling on the reins, because that means stop."

33
00:03:05.109 --> 00:03:11.397
Daisy squeezed her legs against Sunny's sides. "Please walk."

34
00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.220
Sunny started walking.

35
00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.980
"How's this, Daisy? I want to be good so I don't have to leave the farm."

36
00:03:18.323 --> 00:03:21.051
"You're doing great," Daisy whispered.

37
00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.460
"You too!" Sunny said.

38
00:03:24.898 --> 00:03:30.004
Luckily Jan focused mostly on Grace after that.

39
00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:33.310
Daisy was able to whisper what she wanted to Sunny.

40
00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.650
She also tried to pay attention to what Jan was telling Grace.

41
00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.790
"Let's try a trot now," Jan said.

42
00:03:42.038 --> 00:03:46.210
"Daisy, ask Sunny to trot so Grace can watch."

43
00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.830
Daisy gulped. On her beach rides, the horses had only walked.

44
00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:54.230
"Um, can I use my voice aid?"

45
00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.450
"Of course!"

46
00:03:55.836 --> 00:03:58.856
"Trot, Sunny," Daisy called.

47
00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.110
Sunny started moving faster.

48
00:04:01.476 --> 00:04:06.194
It felt bouncy, and Daisy had to work hard to keep her balance.

49
00:04:06.195 --> 00:04:12.569
"Very good, Daisy," Jan called. "You can halt now."

50
00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:15.650
"Stop please, Sunny," Daisy whispered.

51
00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:21.650
"Do I have to?" Sunny said. "Walking and standing are so boring!"

52
00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.050
"Yes!" Daisy said.

53
00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.230
Finally Sunny stopped.

54
00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:29.490
"Well done," Jan called.

55
00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.390
"Grace, would you like to try a trot now?"

56
00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:38.310
Grace shook her head. "I'd rather just walk, if that's okay."

57
00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.710
"Of course," Jan said.

58
00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.190
"We'll only be walking on the trail anyway.

59
00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.270
Let's practice steering.

60
00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.500
Walk Blossom in a circle, like this . . ."

61
00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.900
Daisy was about to steer Sunny in a circle.

62
00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.960
But suddenly he snorted.

63
00:04:57.232 --> 00:05:06.440
"Hey, a cat!" The horse burst into motion, rushing toward the cat!
